{"repositoryId":1327558883,"availability":"available","full":"gouthamganeshm/karnataka-asddo-dashboard","name":"karnataka-asddo-dashboard","description":"Is your EPIC on Karnataka's ASDDO deletion list? Static site over the CEO's SIR 2026 deletion PDFs — 1.08 crore records, no server, EPIC never leaves the browser.","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":6,"forks":1,"created":"2026-08-08T08:29:33Z","updated":"2026-08-29T12:08:29Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://gouthamganeshm.github.io/karnataka-asddo-dashboard/","topics":["asddo","civic-tech","elections","electoral-roll","epic","github-pages","india","karnataka","open-data","sir","static-site"],"demo":"https://gouthamganeshm.github.io/karnataka-asddo-dashboard/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T13:34:22.841Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T13:34:22.841Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T13:34:22.841Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-18T13:34:22.841Z","stars":6,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A static site — no server, no database, hostable on GitHub Pages — that lets a voter check whether their EPIC number appears on the Karnataka ASDDO list (names removed from the electoral roll as Absent, Shifted, Death, Duplicate or Others), and shows the scale of those deletions on a dashboard.","Source: the per-booth PDFs published by the Chief Electoral Officer, Karnataka at . This project reformats them; it is not official.","Coverage: all 34 districts on the source page, 224 constituencies, 59,027 booth PDFs. Where a district publishes nothing readable, the import fails rather than quietly narrowing — see The coverage guard."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/gouthamganeshm/karnataka-asddo-dashboard/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ee405bc92a3bea775cdd93e4f3c184a34f388fb2faca250aa093abbb5341727c","extractedAt":"2026-10-18T13:34:22.979Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T13:34:22.979Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItD